{"parentUuid":"458fd645-dd55-46f9-9d9d-e0c243f14900","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5742d151ebfb6c56","attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14893471 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"111cbfa6-4d42-44aa-8dd6-5a3e96fec673","timestamp":"2026-10-03T20:30:46.962Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14893471 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5742d151ebfb6c56","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a5742d151ebfb6c56"}
{"parentUuid":"111cbfa6-4d42-44aa-8dd6-5a3e96fec673","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5742d151ebfb6c56","attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01KjqbTnFBrTB69LU9zW3fjM","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bff16ff8-13f5-42d4-8f60-5c5954237d1e","timestamp":"2026-10-03T20:30:54.604Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5742d151ebfb6c56","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a5742d151ebfb6c56"}
{"parentUuid":"bff16ff8-13f5-42d4-8f60-5c5954237d1e","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5742d151ebfb6c56","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffwMYjLaw3HiD7YV38gs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #137 for session-start-hook/codex is merged (squash, admin), after every CI check passed. `sr-checks run --base origin/main --head HEAD` came back with no refusals.\n\n**What was flagged**\n- The judge flagged that no test sets `continue: false` on a SessionStart(compact) hook, and that no tagged test checks the compact source at all (neither the matcher nor the recorded `manual-compaction-auto` run).\n- Because my change touched `control_compact.go`, the manual-compaction/codex judge re-ran and flagged an untested gap: no test checks that a PostCompact matcher selects on the trigger.\n\n**Recording**\nI captured a new run, `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/session-start-compact-continue-false`. It uses `model_auto_compact_token_limit=3000` (not 4000; I copied the setup of the existing `manual-compaction-auto-post-stopped` run, which uses 3000) and a hook that prints `continue: false` only when the source is compact.\n\nWhat the real codex did:\n- The hooks fired in the order SessionStart:startup, PreCompact:auto, PostCompact:auto, SessionStart:compact, SessionEnd.\n- It ran one command (the one that triggered the compaction) and the compaction was recorded.\n- The turn then ended cleanly: `turn.completed`, exit 0, no further command and no Stop hook.\n- This is not the abort that a stopped PreCompact or PostCompact causes (exit 1, no `turn.completed`).\n\n**Mock changes**\n- A new `turnloop.ErrTurnEnded` in core (`internal/turnloop/compact.go`, handled in `Run` in `loop.go`).\n- The codex `Compact` in `control_compact.go` now reuses `corehooks.StartHookEndsTurn(startStopped, true)` for the compact start and returns `ErrTurnEnded`.\n\n**Tests**\nAll three are in the new file `codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/session_start_compact_test.go`:\n- Replay of the new recording, tagged `session-start-hook/codex`.\n- SessionStart matching on source compact, tagged `session-start-hook/codex`. It checks that the recorded and mock runs both show 3 compact starts, and tries many matchers.\n- PostCompact matcher selecting on the trigger, tagged `manual-compaction/codex`.\n\n**Spec cell**\nIn `spec/capabilities/session-start-hook.yaml` I added the new run and `manual-compaction-auto` to the codex runs. The modeled-surface deviation now says the mock never resumes or forks, so its starts are startup or compact; it already covered resume as of the rebase. I extended main's existing capability-grounding `continue: false` deviation to cover the compact start (citing the new run). The `statement` is unchanged.\n\nNothing is left red. The session-fork agent can rebase onto main now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":175,"cache_read_input_tokens":106385,"output_tokens":969,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":175},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":969,"cache_read_input_tokens":106385,"cache_creation_input_tokens":175,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":175,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffwMYUxdgW9eATnU3JPa","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a81d166-3fa9-46ff-95b0-fd9f03ea789a","timestamp":"2026-10-03T20:30:54.604Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5742d151ebfb6c56","sess